## Axe

Axes excel at chopping trees and can deal devastating critical hits.
 Affected by **Axe** skill.

| Weapon | Damage | Crit | Speed | Range | Durability | Weight |
|--------|--------|------|-------|-------|------------|--------|
| **Wood Axe** | 1.3-3 | 50% | 1 | 1.35 | 15 | 3 |
