| **Axe** | 0.8-2 | 20% | 1 | 1.2 | 13 | 3 |
| **Hand Axe** | 0.7-1.5 | 15% | 1 | 1.1 | 10 | 2 |
| **Raw Axe** | 0.5-1.5 | 15% | 1 | 1.2 | 5 | 1.2 |

